{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mighty Claw is a 2D grappling hook platformer where your creativity knows no limits: Attach your titular Claw to terrain, conveyor belts, chronically bored pet elephants, and pretty much anything you can think of!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the Claw to chain fluid movement and find creative solutions: Precision movement, momentum control, and quick thinking are rewarded. Levels can be completed in multiple ways, encouraging experimentation and skill expression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swing like crazy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386380/extras/e26f6470b06f4a83948ad3464f1383d0.poster.avif?t=1767822814\" width=800 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386380/extras/e26f6470b06f4a83948ad3464f1383d0.webm?t=1767822814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386380/extras/e26f6470b06f4a83948ad3464f1383d0.mp4?t=1767822814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spin and climb!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386380/extras/65e3cbc9426cbef689710a2f3d0cf1b9.poster.avif?t=1767822814\" width=800 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386380/extras/65e3cbc9426cbef689710a2f3d0cf1b9.webm?t=1767822814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386380/extras/65e3cbc9426cbef689710a2f3d0cf1b9.mp4?t=1767822814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab and throw!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386380/extras/3f276b8430f31655e79836f394178231.poster.avif?t=1767822814\" width=800 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386380/extras/3f276b8430f31655e79836f394178231.webm?t=1767822814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386380/extras/3f276b8430f31655e79836f394178231.mp4?t=1767822814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the village of a teenage boy gets invaded by a megalomaniac conqueror, his chronically bored pet elephant and an army of somewhat incompetent totally useless troops, our young hero comes across the mysterious Claw. Accompanied by his newly-found power of grappling, he sets out on a journey to free different areas occupied by the conqueror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386380/extras/1be4bd0248db2161b752ffb88b6fba2e.avif?t=1767822814\" width=1100 height=517 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of cool grapple moves to perform</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple creative solutions for the challenges of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth swinging controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wacky cast of characters inhabiting a colorful cartoon world\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upbeat, catchy soundtrack that keeps you hooked</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2386380?t=1767822814","backg